761	+---
762	+title: Modular Planter Export Block
763	+id: modular_planters:export
764	+type: block
765	+---
766	+
767	+The export block has 54 slots that hold outputs until something pulls them out. Only the multiblock can insert. Anything can extract. It drops its contents when broken.
768	+
769	+**Crafting**
770	+<CraftingRecipe
771	+    slots={[
772	+        'minecraft:iron_block', 'minecraft:hopper', 'minecraft:iron_block',
773	+        'minecraft:hopper', 'agritechevolved:silo', 'minecraft:hopper',
774	+        'minecraft:iron_block', 'minecraft:hopper', 'minecraft:iron_block'
775	+    ]}
776	+    result="modular_planters:export"
777	+    count={1}
778	+/>
779	+
780	+Items extracted from the [core](@modular_planters:core) come out of the export blocks.
781	+
782	+When there is no room in the export blocks, [planter blocks](@modular_planters:planter) wait. Nothing is voided. With an [ME block](@modular_planters:me), harvests go into ME first and whatever ME does not take goes into the export blocks.
783	diff --git a/wiki/content/fertilizer.mdx b/wiki/content/fertilizer.mdx
