788	@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
789	+---
790	+title: Modular Planter Fertilizer Block
791	+id: modular_planters:fertilizer
792	+type: block
793	+---
794	+
795	+The fertilizer block has 27 slots shared by every planter block. It accepts only ATE fertilizers. It drops its contents when broken.
796	+
797	+**Crafting**
798	+<CraftingRecipe
799	+    slots={[
800	+        'minecraft:iron_block', 'minecraft:bone_block', 'minecraft:iron_block',
801	+        'minecraft:bone_block', 'agritechevolved:fertilizer_spreader', 'minecraft:bone_block',
802	+        'minecraft:iron_block', 'minecraft:bone_block', 'minecraft:iron_block'
803	+    ]}
804	+    result="modular_planters:fertilizer"
805	+    count={1}
806	+/>
807	+
808	+Items inserted into the [core](@modular_planters:core) go to the fertilizer blocks, and only fertilizers are accepted.
809	+
810	+Fertilizer is taken from the first non-empty slot of the fertilizer blocks. Each tick, [planter blocks](@modular_planters:planter) claim it in position order, and each group claims one item for every one of its seeds or nothing. A group without a claim grows and harvests unfertilized that tick. A claim uses up fertilizer only when its group harvests.
