879	+++ b/wiki/content/planter.mdx
880	@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@
881	+---
882	+title: Modular Planter Block
883	+id: modular_planters:planter
884	+type: block
885	+---
886	+
887	+The planter block grows one seed type, up to 64 seeds. It has a seed slot, a soil slot and two module slots.
888	+
889	+**Crafting**
890	+<CraftingRecipe
891	+    slots={[
892	+        'modular_planters:frame', 'modular_planters:frame', 'modular_planters:frame',
893	+        'modular_planters:frame', 'agritechevolved:infused_farmland', 'modular_planters:frame',
894	+        'modular_planters:frame', 'modular_planters:frame', 'modular_planters:frame'
895	+    ]}
896	+    result="modular_planters:planter"
897	+    count={1}
898	+/>
899	+
900	+A planter block costs 8 [frames](@modular_planters:frame), so 64 Powered Planters plus 8 blocks of iron and one Infused Farmland.
901	+
902	+**Growing**
903	+- Growing seeds is the smaller of the seed count and the soil count. Seeds past that stay idle.
904	+- One module covers one seed. Module 1 covers the first seeds in the bin and module 2 does the same, so seeds fill both modules first.
905	+- Seeds with the same modules and the same seed data grow as a group. Each seed levels on its own, as it would in its own Powered Planter.
906	+- Growth time, power and fertilizer follow ATE's formulas and are read from ATE's live config.
907	+- When there is no room in the [export blocks](@modular_planters:export), planter blocks wait. Nothing is voided.
908	+- Breaking a block drops everything it holds.
909	+
910	+The [core](@modular_planters:core) applies a built-in cloche to every planter block. It always works and needs no item.
