1033	+---
1034	+title: Example Builds
1035	+---
1036	+
1037	+## Raised bed under a cloche
1038	+
1039	+Corner legs, a 3x3 bed and a 3x3 glass canopy.
1040	+
1041	+<ModAsset location="modular_planters:builds/raised_bed" width={512} />
1042	+
1043	+## Vertical farm
1044	+
1045	+A 2x2 tower with the core on the bottom floor and floors of planter blocks above it.
1046	+
1047	+<ModAsset location="modular_planters:builds/vertical_farm" width={512} />
1048	+
1049	+## Rosette
1050	+
1051	+One block tall. The core is in the center, the other parts take the four diagonal corners, and planter blocks extend outward in four arms.
1052	+
1053	+<ModAsset location="modular_planters:builds/rosette" width={512} />
1054	+
